    "sections": {
        "description": "Cleaning Maintenance is a modern, versatile WordPress theme designed for janitorial services, commercial and residential cleaning, office cleaning, carpet and window cleaning, floor maintenance, deep cleaning, sanitation, eco-friendly cleaning, and facility management businesses. Perfect for individual cleaners, small businesses, and large cleaning service providers, this theme creates a professional and trustworthy online presence. a clean, responsive, and user-friendly design, visitors can easily explore services, view testimonials, and interact with your business seamlessly. The theme adapts flawlessly across all devices, ensuring a consistent experience for desktop, tablet, and mobile users. Its dynamic features allow businesses to showcase services, schedules, cleaning solutions, and team profiles effectively, fostering engagement and building client confidence. Cleaning Maintenance WordPress theme is an ideal solution for professionals and companies aiming to elevate their digital footprint, enhance credibility, and connect with a broader audience in the cleaning and maintenance industry."
    },
